# The public Supabase URL and key live in wrangler.jsonc ("vars", and "env.test" for the local database),
# so no .env file is needed to run the site.
#
# Preview mode (local only) goes in .env.development.local, read by `npm run dev` and never by a build, so
# the secret key can't be copied into dist/. It shows the latest unpublished tip preview:
#   SITE_PREVIEW=true
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=<Supabase dashboard > Project Settings > API Keys > secret key>
